« OOS harvest / evaluation request »

Touching this file is what starts .github/workflows/oos-harvest-and-evaluate.yml.
The workflow lives only on this research branch, and GitHub offers
workflow_dispatch only for workflows on the default branch, so a gated push
trigger is how a branch-local workflow gets started without touching main.

STAGE=harvest reads all 46 post-cutoff hourly parts off the recorder's volume
(read-only) and reduces each one to BTC 15m rows.

STAGE=evaluate merges one named harvest, checks completeness, builds the OOS
state table and runs the FROZEN 2939ee67 / c31a5e32 evaluation. It is requested
exactly once.

STAGE=harvest
HARVEST_RUN_ID=
CUTOFF_SLUG=cpc-btc-updown-15m-2026-10-02-2045z
NOTE=development ends at the cutoff; only windows strictly after it are OOS
